● The command to start the server:

  cd /home/charles/HR_policy_bot_proto && source .venv/bin/activate && uvicorn src.main:app --host 0.0.0.0 --port 8000

  Or if you want it as a one-liner you can paste directly:

  cd /home/charles/HR_policy_bot_proto && source .venv/bin/activate && uvicorn src.main:app --host 0.0.0.0 --port 8000 --reload

  (--reload is optional — auto-restarts on file changes, handy during dev.)

  If the server is currently running, kill it first with Ctrl+C in its terminal, then run the above. GUI will be at http://localhost:8000.

